11 258 l 1315 258 1315 260 1311 260 m 1196 374 l 1200 374 1200 376 1196 376 m 1248 284 l 1252 284 1252 286 1248 286 m 931 300 l 933 300 933 302 931 302 m 1295 342 l 1299 342 1299 344 1295 344 m 1049 319 l 1051 319 1051 321 1049 321 m 1243 372 l 1247 372 1247 374 1243 374 m 1301 298 l 1303 298 1303 300 1301 300 m 1393 322 l 1395 322 1395 324 1393 324 m 1353 302 l 1357 302 1357 304 1353 304 m 1341 285 l 1343 285 1343 287 1341 287 m 1339 359 l 1341 359 1341 361 1339 361 m 1305 350 l 1307 350 1307 352 1305 352 m 1046 390 l 1048 390 1048 392 1046 392 m 965 264 l 967 264 967 266 965 266 m 586 380 l 588 380 588 382 586 382 m 1048 265 l 1052 265 1052 267 1048 267 m 594 314 l 598 314 598 316 594 316 m 1227 304 l 1229 304 1229 306 1227 306 m 1322 392 l 1326 392 1326 394 1322 394 m 962 399 l 966 399 966 401 962 401 m 909 340 l 911 340 911 342 909 342 m 615 366 l 619 366 619 368 615 368 m 674 360 l 678 360 678 362 674 362 m 551 296 l 553 296 553 298 551 298 m 631 317 l 635 317 635 319 631 319 m 809 272 l 813 272 813 274 809 274
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must stop. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay here and rest a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just realized who those Red Knights are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:03:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're from my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they are just a bloodthirsty\Nmob flailing their swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how great their\Nnumber, there is nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us knights take a crack at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truths!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a tight formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll bust through their ranks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:04:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.87,0:05:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta tell the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to call this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:06:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't get any orders from the\NEmperor about those red bastards, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't say anything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, if we decided to go\Nand slaughter them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he shouldn't have a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna save our people on\Nthe other side of the canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon as the bridge goes up, I want\Neveryone to charge the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what bridge? There\Nain't no... There will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ask someone to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No time to shimmy across a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to jump across it instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, babe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're weaker than they look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's from the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help. For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:09:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one that made those little\Nmountains and the canyon behind me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. All right. Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to make a bridge\Nacross the canyon for my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do that, and my 4,000 pugilists\Nwill cross over and help you fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll crush these red bastards together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll help?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not think this\None is the type to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help your people cross over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are indifferent, heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fiends, be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discharge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the top of that hill, I can\Nincinerate them all. Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! It's not set!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhance armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, I'm going to kill you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way or a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release the collection!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander, go after her.\NThanks, kid. Watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lose them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.04,0:12:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I trained them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they got us hemmed in here,\Nso South's the only way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to take them\Nall on at some point,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's so many,\Nit ain't gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll break through the lines\Nand head South, like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then put as much distance\Nbetween us and them as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as we're far enough away, I'll\Ntry to make another canyon to block them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bring a message!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,M 'lady Alice has been taken!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor Vector snatched her\Nup and flew off with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spotter saw his dragon\Nheading due south! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took off with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then when I saw him, he wasn't\Njust checking out the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Alice is the Priestess\Nof Light, ain't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole point of my people\Nbeing here was to catch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does the Emperor want her so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'll happen when he gets her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Vecta's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To take Alice, the Priestess of\NLight, down to the world's end altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once there, this world and everything\Nin it is going to be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dragon cannot fly forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with passengers, they\Nonly last half a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I guess you should get\Ngoing while the getting's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd let us go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.02,0:13:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're from the Dark\NTerritory and he's your emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the start of this, Vecta gave\Nhis Council of Ten an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:14:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That all he wanted was this\Npriestess of light and now that he's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got what he wanted I'd say his\Norder to us has been fulfilled,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and my people are\Nfree to do whatever now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so if he wanted to help you\Nand the human army steal the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,priestess back from the Emperor\Nwe could a choice is up to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't disobey the\NEmperor if he tells us we
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to fight you then\Nmy people have to obey
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or you'll kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here's what we can do for you we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep the red guys busy\Nhere while you and the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,human army catch up to\Nthe Emperor when you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you tell him what\Nbastard we're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dyin' for nothin', you tell\Nhim we ain't his pulpits no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're talkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:14:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep that line open, ya hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's your exit, but\Nyou better hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't hold it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I will stay here with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then, good luck and stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about this, woman? Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about this, Sheyta?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there's no guarantee\Nyou'll survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot let anyone else slash you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only I reserve the right to. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Says you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me some fire, pugilists!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get in the circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defend position!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If any of them tries to attack,\Nwind up and give them hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to kick some ass, champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.02,0:16:03.44,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF4F1F2&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\pos(958.18,880.2)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(10,130,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(20,140,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(30,150,\alpha&H00&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(40,160,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(50,170,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(60,180,\alpha&H00&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(70,190,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(80,200,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(90,210,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(100,220,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(110,230,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,240,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(130,250,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(140,260,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(150,270,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(160,280,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(170,290,\alpha&H00&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(181,301,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(191,311,\alpha&H00&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(201,321,\alpha&H00&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(211,331,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(221,341,\alpha&H00&)}1 {\alpha&HFF&\t(231,351,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(241,361,\alpha&H00&)}M {\alpha&HFF&\t(251,371,\alpha&H00&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(261,381,\alpha&H00&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(271,391,\alpha&H00&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(281,401,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(291,411,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(301,421,\alpha&H00&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(311,431,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(321,441,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(331,451,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(341,461,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(351,471,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(362,482,\alpha&H00&)}e
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were out for a while there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something so I know\Nyour brain didn't get fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.30,0:16:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fell down some bottomless pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds both\Nhorrible and pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you've been\Nout for eight hours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, eight hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you look so panicked, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right before you got\Nyour ass honed in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dialed the time back\Ndown to one-to-one. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you messing\Naround with the time for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.14,0:16:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In 12 hours the GSDF is\Ngonna bust in here and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll be gunning for us I\Nknow I've been keeping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cranked the time down because\NCaptain Miller ordered me to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.46,0:16:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using our satellite connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just logged a bunch of players from the\NUS into the dark territory The hell for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a log of you and the captain's\Nmovements in there a few minutes ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He passed the place you croaked\Nand is heading due south.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And get this, he's not traveling\Nwith the Dark Territory's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.78,0:17:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could be chasing after\NAlice, or he's got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, you should crank up the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That part in red is\Nwhat's left of the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,players.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.65,0:17:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that black circle half-surrounded by
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is a chunk of the\NDark Territory's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our problem is that white dot that's\Nthe human army or what's left of them
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,according to the log There's about 700 give\Nor take if they catch up to the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be no bueno
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:18:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got to be stopped ASAP then you\Nbetter get to it what you got in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Got us a second batch\Nof us players on standby
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When there's 20 thou I'll drop\Nthem on top of the human army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's 28 times their numbers.\NIt's gonna be a friggin' massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll crank time up\Nto a thousand to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll sit back and let\Nthe captain do his thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll have all the time\Nin the world and then
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some to get Alice to\Nthe southern terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it goes as smooth as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The human side's army is a hell\Nof a lot tougher than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell, those integrity knights\Nare straight up badasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sat there and watched as they mowed\Ndown the dark territory's front line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lost thousands in\None gigantic flash of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flash of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It totally was!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget that, bitch! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:18:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess what, you little four-eyed freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:19:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just figured out the Wrath guys in Subcon\Nare doing the same thing we are. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they got Japanese VR MMO players\Nlogged in and working with the Human Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.78,0:19:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll bet if Lightning Flash Asuna's in\Nthere, that dual-wielding bastard is too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going back in, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get me prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send me to the Human Army's location\Nwith the second batch of players.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you wasted the only Dark\NKnight account we had, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I got is a basic grunt like\Nthe others, so no complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't using one of those accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a special one instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Sir Renly is going to\Nbarrel through them. Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No rapid fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm more used to\Nsingle-shot weapons anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm late. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SINONON!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:48.14,0:21:52.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&HF9FEFE&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:21:52.66,0:21:55.67,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:21:55.67,0:21:59.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:21:59.79,0:22:03.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFAFAFA&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:22:04.83,0:22:05.26,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 4,0:22:05.26,0:22:12.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H372317&}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:12.68,0:22:17.49,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H342517&}So bright that they hurt to look at now
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.49,0:22:25.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H45443F&\t(5338,5963,\c&H635253&)}If I was capable of living life all alone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.69,0:22:32.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H23241A&}I never would have loved in the first place
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.46,0:22:38.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H351405&\t(610,1903,\c&H5B3445&)}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your story.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.62,0:22:42.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H2C1428&}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though there's no love!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.65,0:22:50.34,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H5A3E4A&}Pieces of love still linger all over my body
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for love.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.34,0:22:59.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H3F2930&}My only wish, my only wish is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal is just.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:59.52,0:23:07.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H674256&}May you, wherever you are now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dohka, a Knight mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.00,0:23:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doko ka de, Knight imas yonini?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:07.36,0:23:08.57,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H674256&}Be crying too
Dialogue: 4,0:23:08.57,0:23:11.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFEFEFE&}Be crying too
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
